<p. 4> 
durgādevīṃ tarpayāmi | iti triḥ tarpaṇaṃ datvā | śrīdurgāparivarāṃstarpayāmi 
iti sakṛtsaṃtarpya | sveṣṭadevatāṃ sūryaṃ ca praṇamet | tato jalāduttiryadhauta 
vastrāṇi paridhāya | hrīṃ ādhāraśakti kamalāsanāya namaḥ | ityāsanaṃ 
saṃpūjya |

pṛthvi tvayā dhṛtā lokā devitvaṃ viṣṇunā dhṛtā ||
tvaṃ ca dhāraya māṃ devi pavitraṃ kuru cāsanam || 1 || 

iti stutvā | āsane upaviśya |

<p. 5a> 
vibhūti dhāraṇaṃ kuryāt | tadyathā | hauṃ sadyojātāya namaḥ  śivāya śirasi | 
hauṃ vāmadevāya namaḥ śivāya lalāṭe | hauṃ aghorāya namaḥ śivāya 
vakṣasi | hauṃ tatpuruṣāya namaḥ śivāya dakṣiṇavāhau | hauṃ īśānāya 
namaḥ śivāya vāmavāhau | iti maṃtreṇa vibhūti dhāraṇaṃ kṛtvā | vāme 
śrīgurubhyo namaḥ | paramagurubhyo namaḥ | parāparagurubhyo namaḥ dakṣiṇe |

<p. 5b> 
gaṃ gaṇeśāya namaḥ | mūrddhni śrīdurgādevatāyai namaḥ | iti nasvā | phaḍiti 
maṃtreṇa gandhapuṣpābhyāṃ karau saṃśodhya ūrddhorddhvatālatrayaṃ 
datvā | choṭikābhirdaśadigbandhanaṃ vidhāya | ramiti maṃtreṇa jaladhārayā 
vahniprākāraṃ vicintya | bhūtaśuddhiṃ kuryāt | tadyathā | aṃke uttānau karau 
kṛtvā | haṃ sa iti maṃtreṇa jīvātmānaṃ dīpakalikākāraṃ | 

<p. 6a> 
mūlādhārāvasthita kuṃḍalinyā saha suṣumṇāvarttmanā mūlādhāra 
svādhiṣṭhāna maṇipūraka anāhata viśuddhājñākhya ṣaṭcakrāṇi bhitvā 
śirovasthitādhomukha sahasradalakamalakarṇikāntargata parātmani saṃyojya | 
svaśarīre pādādi jānuparyantaṃ caturasraṃ pītavarṇaṃ vajralāṃchitaṃ laṃ 
bījaṃ pārthivamaṇḍalaṃ dhyāyet | jānvādi nābhiparyantaṃ

<p. 6b> 
arddhacandrākāraṃ śubhraṃ padmadvayāṃkitaṃ vaṃ bījaṃ jalamaṃḍalaṃ 
dhyāyet | nābherhṛdayaparyantaṃ trikoṇaṃ svastikāṃkitaṃ raktavarṇaṃ raṃ 
bījaṃ vahnimaṇḍalaṃ dhyāyet | hṛdayādbhrūmadhyaparyantaṃ dhūmravarṇaṃ 
vartulaṃ ṣaḍbindu lāṃchitaṃ yaṃ bījaṃ vāyumaṃḍalaṃ dhyāyet | 
bhrūmadhyādbrahmarandhraparyantaṃ vartulaṃ nīlavarṇaṃ haṃ bījaṃ 
gaganamaṇḍalaṃ dhyāyet | tataḥ pṛthivyaptejo 

<p. 7a> 
vāyvākāśagandharasarūpasparśaśabdanāsikājihvācakṣustvak 
śrotravākpāṇipādapāyūpastha prakṛti manobuddhi ahaṃkāreti caturviṃśati 
tatvāni kāraṇakrameṇa tatraivalīnāni vibhāvya | yaṃ iti dhūmravarṇaṃ 
vāyubījaṃ vāmanāsāpuṭe vicintya | tasya ṣoḍaśavārajapena dehamāpūrya 
nāsāpuṭau dhṛtvā catuḥṣaṣṭivāra japena kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtvā |

<p. 7b> 
vāmakukṣistha kṛṣṇavarṇa pāpapuruṣe sahadehaṃ saṃśoṣya 
dvātriṃśadvārajapena dakṣanāsayā vāyurecayet | dakṣanāsāpuṭe ramiti 
vahnibījaṃ raktavarṇaṃ dhyātvā | tasya ṣoḍaśavārajapena dehamāpūrya 
nāsāpuṭau dhṛtvā | catuḥṣaṣṭivārajapena kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtvā | pāpena 
sahadehaṃ dagdhvā tasya dvātriṃśadvārajapena vāmanāsayā bhasmanā 
vāyuṃ recayet | yamiti candrabīje śuklavarṇaṃ vāmanāsikāyāṃ 

<p. 8a> 
dhṛtvā ṣoḍaśavārajapena lalāṭe candraṃ nītvā vamiti varuṇabījasya 
catuḥṣaṣṭivārajapena tasmāt lalāṭacandrākulitasudhayā mātṛkāvarṇātmikayā 
samastadehaṃ viracayya | lamiti pṛthvībījasya dvātriśadvārajapena dehaṃ 
sudṛḍhaṃ 

<p. 8b> 
vibhāvya dakṣiṇanāsāpuṭena vāyuṃ recayet | tatohaṃ iti ākāśabījaṃ smaran 
sarvāṇyaṃgāni racitāni vibhāvayet | tataḥ sohamiti maṃtreṇa kuṃḍalinyā saha 
jīvātmānaṃ caturviṃśati tatvāni ca svasvasthānasthitāni vibhāvya | 
prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ kuryāt | tadyathā | asya śrīprāṇapratiṣṭhā maṃtrasya 
brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarā ṛṣayaḥ ṛgyajuḥsāmāni 

<p. 9a> 
chandāṃsi prāṇaśaktirdevatā āṃ bījaṃ hrīṃ śaktiḥ kroṃ kīlaṃ 
prāṇasthāpane viniyogaḥ | śirasi brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarebhyo ṛṣibhyo namaḥ 
mukhe | ṛgyajuḥsāmabhyaśchandobhyo namaḥ hṛdi | prāṇaśaktyai devatāyai 
namaḥ guhye | āṃ bījāya namaḥ pādayoḥ | hrīṃ śaktaye namaḥ sarvāṃge | 
kroṃ kīlakāya namaḥ | aṃ kaṃ khaṃ gaṃ ghaṃ ṅaṃ āṃ nabhovāyvagnivāri 
bhūmyātmane 

<p. 9b> 
aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ | iṃ caṃ chaṃ jaṃ jhaṃ ṅaṃ īṃ 
śabdasparśarūparasagandhātmane tarjanībhyāṃ svāhā | 
uṃ ṭaṃ ṭhaṃ ḍaṃ ḍhaṃ ṇaṃ ūṃ śrotratvaṅnayanajihvāghrāṇātmane 
madhyamābhyāṃ vaṣaṭ | eṃ taṃ thaṃ daṃ dhaṃ naṃ aiṃ 
vākpāṇipādapāyupasthātmane anāmikābhyāṃ huṃ | oṃ paṃ phaṃ baṃ 
bhaṃ maṃ auṃ vaktavyādānagamanavisargānandātmane kaniṣṭhikābhyāṃ 
vauṣaṭ | aṃ yaṃ raṃ laṃ vaṃ śaṃ ṣaṃ saṃ haṃ laṃ 

<p. 10a> 
kṣaṃ aṃḥ manobuddhyahaṃkāra cittavijñānātmane 
karatalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ phaṭ | aṃ kaṃ khaṃ gaṃ ghaṃ ṅaṃ āṃ nabho 
vāyvagnivāribhūmyātmane hṛdayāya namaḥ | iṃ caṃ chaṃ jaṃ jhaṃ ñaṃ 
īṃ śabdasparśarūparasagaṃdhātmane śirase svāhā | 
uṃ ṭaṃ ṭhaṃ ḍaṃ ḍhaṃ ṇaṃ ūṃ śrotratvaṅnayanajihvāghrāṇātmane 
śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | eṃ taṃ thaṃ daṃ dhaṃ naṃ aiṃ 
vākpāṇipādapāyūpasthātmane kavacāya huṃ | oṃ paṃ phaṃ baṃ bhaṃ maṃ 
auṃ 

<p. 10b> 
vaktavyādānavisargānandātmane netratrayāya vauṣaṭ | oṃ yaṃ raṃ laṃ vaṃ 
śaṃ ṣaṃ saṃ haṃ kṣaṃ aṁ manobudhyahaṃkāracintātmane astrāya phaṭ | iti 
nyāsaṃ kṛtvā | siṃhasthā iti | hṛdaye hastaṃ nidhāya āṁ hrīṁ kroṁ yaṃ raṃ laṃ 
vaṃ śaṃ ṣaṃ saṃ hoṁ oṃ kṣaṃ saṃ haṃ saḥ hrīṁ oṃ haṃ saḥ mama jīva iha 
sthitaḥ | āṁ hrīṁ kroṁ yaṃ raṃ laṃ vaṃ śaṃ ṣaṃ saṃ hoṁ aṃ saṃ haṃ saḥ oṃ 
haṃ saḥ mama

<p. 11a> 
sarvendriyāṇi | āṁ hrīṁ kroṁ yaṃ raṃ laṃ vaṃ śaṃ ṣaṃ saṃ hoṁ aṃ kṣaṃ saṃ 
haṃ saḥ hrīṁ oṃ haṃ saḥ mama vāṅmanaścakṣuśrotraghrāṇaprāṇā ityāgatya 
sukhaṃ ciraṃ tiṣṭhantu svāhā | oṃ kṣaṃ saṃ haṃ saḥ hrīṁ oṃ iti

<p. 11b> 
prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ kṛtvā | antarmātṛkā nyāsaṃ kuryāt | tadyathā | asya śrī 
aṃtarmātṛvidyāyāḥ brahmā(-)ṛṣirgāyatrīchandaḥ antarmātṛkādevatā halbhyo 
bījāni svarāḥ śaktayaḥ mātṛkānyāse viniyogaḥ | śirasi brahmaṇe ṛṣaye 
namaḥ | mukhe gāyatrīchandase namaḥ | hṛdi mātṛkāyai devatāyai namaḥ | guhye 
halbhyo bījebhyo namaḥ | pādayoḥ svarebhyaḥ 

<p. 12a> 
śaktibhyo namaḥ sarvāṅge | avyaktāya kīlakāya namaḥ | aṃ kaṃ khaṃ gaṃ 
ghaṃ ṅaṃ āṃ aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ | iṃ caṃ chaṃ jaṃ jhaṃ ñaṃ īṃ 
tarjanībhyāṃ svāhā | uṃ ṭaṃ ṭhaṃ ḍaṃ ḍhaṃ ṇaṃ ūṃ madhyamābhyāṃ 
vaṣaṭ | eṃ taṃ thaṃ daṃ dhaṃ naṃ aiṃ anāmikābhyāṃ hum | oṃ paṃ phaṃ 
baṃ bhaṃ maṃ auṃ kaniṣṭhikābhyāṃ vauṣaṭ | aṃ yaṃ raṃ laṃ vaṃ 
śaṃ ṣaṃ saṃ haṃ laṃ kṣaṃ aṃḥ karatalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ phaṭ | aṃ kaṃ 
khaṃ gaṃ ghaṃ ṅaṃ āṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ | iṃ caṃ chaṃ jaṃ jhaṃ ñaṃ īṃ 
śirase svāhā |

<p. 12b> 
uṃ ṭaṃ ṭhaṃ ḍaṃ ḍhaṃ ṇaṃ ūṃ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | eṃ taṃ thaṃ daṃ dhaṃ 
naṃ aiṃ kavacāya huṃ | oṃ paṃ phaṃ baṃ bhaṃ maṃ auṃ netratrayāya 
vauṣaṭ | aṃ yaṃ raṃ laṃ vaṃ śaṃ ṣaṃ saṃ haṃ laṃ kṣaṃ aṃḥ astrāya 
phaṭ || 

dhyānam ||                                                                                                               

paṃcāśallipibhirvibhakta mukhadoḥ yanmadhyavakṣasthalāṃ 
bhāsvanmaulinibaddha candraśakalāmāpīna tuṅgastanīm ||
mudrāmakṣaguṇaṃ sudhāḍhyakalaśaṃ vidyāṃ ca hastāmbujair 
<p. 13a> 
vibhrāṇāṃ viśada prabhāṃ trinayanāṃ vāgdevatāmāśraye || 1 || 

iti dhyātvā | 

kaṃṭhadeśe ṣoḍaśadalakamale viśuddhacakre aṃ āṃ iṃ īṃ uṃ ūṃ ṛṃ ṝṃ 
ḷṃ ḹṃ eṃ aiṃ oṃ auṃ aṃ aḥ prādakṣiṇyena manasā vinyaset | hṛdi | 
anāhatacakre dvādaśadalakamale | kaṃ khaṃ gaṃ ghaṃ ṅaṃ caṃ chaṃ jaṃ 
jhaṃ ñaṃ ṭaṃ ṭhaṃ iti vinyaset | nābhau | maṇipūracakre daśadalakamale 
| ḍaṃ ḍhaṃ ṇaṃ taṃ thaṃ daṃ dhaṃ naṃ paṃ phaṃ iti vinyaset | liṃgadeśe | 
svādhiṣṭhāna caktre

<p. 13b> 
ṣaḍdalakamale baṃ bhaṃ maṃ yaṃ raṃ laṃ iti nyaset | gudadvāre | 
mūlādhāracakre caturdalakamale | vaṃ śaṃ ṣaṃ saṃ iti nyaset | bhrūmadhye | 
ājñācakre dvidalakamale | haṃ kṣaṃ iti nyaset | ityantarmātṛkānyāsaṃ 
vidhāya | sṛṣṭimātṛkānyāsaṃ kuryāt | tadyathā | 

asya śrīsṛṣṭimātṛkā sarasvatī maṃtrasya brahmā(-)ṛṣirgāyatrīchando 
mātṛkāsarasvatīdevatā halbhyo bījāni svarāḥ śaktayaḥ 

<p. 14a> 
sṛṣṭimātṛkānyāse viniyogaḥ | nyāsa dhyānaṃ ca antarmātṛkā vadatrāpi 
kṛtvā nyaset | aṃ namaḥ śirasi | āṃ namo mukhe | iṃ namo dakṣiṇanetre | īṃ 
namo vāmanetre | uṃ namo dakṣiṇakarṇe | ūṃ namo vāmakarṇe | ṛṃ namo 
dakṣiṇanāsikāyāṃ | ṝṃ namo vāmanāsikāyāṃ | ḷṃ namo dakṣiṇakapole 
| ḹṃ namo vāmakapole | eṃ nama ūrddhvoṣṭhe | aiṃ namaḥ adharoṣṭhe | oṃ 
namaḥ ūrddhvadantapaṃktau |

<p. 14b> 
auṃ namaḥ adhodantapaṃktau | aṃ namaḥ śirasi | aṃḥ namaḥ mukhe | kaṃ namo 
dakṣabāhumūle | khaṃ namaḥ kūrpare | gaṃ namo maṇibandhe | ghaṃ namaḥ 
aṃgulimūle | ṅaṃ namaḥ aṃgulyagre | caṃ namo vāmabāhumūle | chaṃ 
namaḥ kūrpare | jaṃ namo maṇibandhe | jhaṃ namaḥ aṃgulimūle | ñaṃ namaḥ 
aṃgulyagre | ṭaṃ namo dakṣiṇapādamūle | ṭhaṃ namo jānuni | ḍaṃ namaḥ 
gulphe | ḍhaṃ namaḥ aṃgulimūle | ṇaṃ namaḥ aṃgulyagre |

<p. 15a> 
taṃ namo vāmapādamūle | thaṃ namo jānuni | daṃ namo gulphe | dhaṃ namaḥ 
aṃgulimūle | naṃ namaḥ aṃgulyagre | paṃ namo dakṣiṇakukṣau | phaṃ namo 
vāmakukṣau | baṃ namaḥ pṛṣṭhe | bhaṃ namo nābhau | maṃ namaḥ udare | yaṃ 
namo hṛdi | raṃ namo dakṣāṃse | laṃ namaḥ kakudi | vaṃ namo vāmāṃse | 
śaṃ namo hṛdayādidakṣiṇabāhau | ṣaṃ namo hṛdayādivāmabāhau | saṃ namo 
hṛdayādidakṣiṇapāde | haṃ namo hṛdayādi vāmapāde | laṃ

<p. 15b> 
namo hṛdayādi udare | kṣaṃ namo hṛdayādi mukhe | iti sṛṣṭimātṛkānyāsaṃ 
vidhāya | 

svamūlamaṃtrokta ṛṣyādi nyāsa japādikaṃ kṛtvā | pūjāṃ kuryāt | tadyathā | 
duṃ ātmatatvāya namaḥ | duṃ vidyātatvāya namaḥ | duṃ śivatatvāya namaḥ | 
ityācamya | dīpaṃ prajvālya | 

namostvanantāya sahasramūrtaye sahasrapādākṣiśiroruvāhave || 
sahasranāmne puruṣāya sāsvate sahasrakoṭi yugadhāriṇe namaḥ || 2 || 

<p. 16a> 
iti dīpaṃ saṃpūjya | kalaśaṃ saṃsthāpya | skaṃdhadeśe | gaṃ gaṇeśāya 
namaḥ | iti gaṇeśamāvāhya saṃpūjya | kalaśamukhe | vaṃ varuṇāya namaḥ | 
ityāvāhya pūjayet | tatraiva | sūryādi navagrahān | gauryādi ṣoḍaśamātṛ 
āvāhya pūjayet | tatsaditi māsapakṣādyullikhya | yathānāmagotraḥ 
yathānāmavarmā ahaṃ mama iṣṭadevatā prītidvārā sakalābhīṣṭasiddhaye 
yathā militopacāraiḥ 

<p. 16b> 
śrīdurgādevatāyāḥ pūjanamahaṃ kariṣye | iti saṃkalpaṃ 
vidhāyārghasthāpanaṃ kuryāt | tadyathā | svāgrataḥ kiṃcidvāmabhāge | 
candanādinā trikoṇaṣaṭkoṇavṛtta caturasrātmakaṃ maṃḍalaṃ kṛtvā 
puṣpākṣataiḥ ādhāraśaktaye namaḥ | iti saṃpūjya | tripadikāṃ mūlena 
prakṣālya | maṃ agnimaṃḍalāya daśakalātmane śrīdurgārghapātrāsanāya 
namaḥ | iti tripadikāṃ pratiṣṭhāpya | tatra agnerdhūmrādi daśakalābhyo

<p. 17a> 
namaḥ | iti saṃpūjya | arghapātraṃ phaḍiti prakṣālya | sūryamaṃḍalāya 
dvādaśakalātmane śrīdurgārghapātrāya namaḥ | ityarghapātramādhāre 
nidhāya | tatra tapinyādi dvādaśakalābhyo namaḥ | iti saṃpūjya | kṣaṃ laṃ haṃ 
saṃ ṣaṃ śaṃ vaṃ laṃ raṃ yaṃ maṃ bhaṃ baṃ phaṃ paṃ naṃ dhaṃ daṃ 
thaṃ taṃ ṇaṃ ḍhaṃ ḍaṃ ṭhaṃ ṭaṃ ñaṃ jhaṃ jaṃ chaṃ caṃ ṅaṃ ghaṃ 
gaṃ khaṃ kaṃ aṃḥ aṃ auṃ oṃ aiṃ eṃ ḹṃ ḷṃ ṝṃ ṛṃ ūṃ uṃ īṃ iṃ 
āṃ aṃ iti prātilomyenoccaran śuddhodakenārghapātraṃ sampūrya |

<p. 17b> 
uṃ candramaṃḍalāya ṣoḍaśakalātmane śrīdurgārghapātrāmṛtāya namaḥ | iti 
saṃpūjyaṃ | tatraiva jale amṛtādi ṣoḍaśakalābhyo namaḥ | iti saṃpūjya | 

gaṃge ca yamune caiva godāvari sarasvati || 
narmade sindhu kāveri jalesminsannidhiṃ kuru || 1 ||

aṃkuśamudrayā kromiti maṃtreṇa sūryamaṃḍalaṃ bhītvā | 

brahmāṇḍodara tīrthāni karaiḥ spṛṣṭāni te rave || 
tena satyena me deva tīrthaṃ dehi (*) vākara || 

<p. 18a> 
iti maṃtreṇa tīrthānyāvāhya | tatra jale devatāṃ dhyātvā | mūlena 
triḥpuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ saṃpūjya | dakṣahastena jalaṃ spṛṣṭvā mūlena 
trirabhimaṃtrya matsyamudrayāchādya | vamiti dhenumudrayāmṛtīkṛtya | 
yonimudrāṃ śaṃkhamudrāṃ ca pradarśya | tatra jalena | 

apavitraḥ pavitro vā sarvāvasthāṃ gatopi vā |
yaḥ smaret puṃḍarīkākṣaṃ savāhyābhyaṃtareṣu ca ||

iti pūjāsāmagrī ātmānaṃ ca siṃcet ||

<p. 18b>	
tataḥ oṃ tatsaditi deśakālamāsatithivārādi pūrvakaṃ smṛtvā | 
amukagotromukavarmā ahaṃ mama iṣṭadevatā prītidvārā 
sakalābhīṣṭasiddhyarthaṃ yathā militopacāraiḥ śrīdurgādevatāyāḥ 
pūjanamahaṃ kariṣye | iti saṃkalpaṃ vidhāya | 

candanādinā | sakarṇikaṃ aṣṭadalaṃ tadvāhye bhūḥpuraṃ cālikhya | tatra 
candanākṣata puṣpādinā

<p. 19a> 
keśareṣu | āṃ prabhāyai namaḥ | īṃ māyāyai namaḥ | ūṃ jayāyai namaḥ | 
eṃ sūkṣmāyai namaḥ | aiṃ viśuddhāyai namaḥ | oṃ naṃdinyai namaḥ | auṃ 
suprabhāyai namaḥ | aṃ vijayāyai namaḥ | aṃḥ sarvasiddhidāyai namaḥ sarvatra | 
madhye | oṃ vajranakhadaṃṣṭrāyudhāya mahāsiṃhāya huṃ phaṭ namaḥ | iti 
pūjayet | tato dhyānokta devatāmāvāhya pūrvokta prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ kṛtvā | 

deveśi bhaktisulabhe parivāra samanvite | 
yāvat tvāṃ pūjayiṣyāmi tāvat tvaṃ susthirā bhava ||

<p. 19b> 
ityāvāhya | durgāyaṃtraṃ pādyādibhiḥ pūjayet | mūlamuccārya śrīdurgāyai 
pādyaṃ samarpayāmi namaḥ | evaṃ arghyaṃ ācamanīyaṃ madhuparkaṃ 
śuddhodakaṃ udvartanam snānīyaṃ punarācamanīyaṃ samarpayāmi | iti 
saṃsnāpya | aṃgaprochanaṃ vibhāvya | mūlāṃte durgāyai vastraṃ 
samarpayāmi namaḥ | gandhaṃ akṣatān siṃdūraṃ puṣpāṇi | tato mūlena 

<p. 20a> 
paṃcapuṣpāṃjalīṃ datvā | hrāṃ hrīṃ duṃ durgāyai hṛdayāya namaḥ | hrīṃ 
hrīṃ duṃ durgāyai śirase svāhā | hrūṃ hrīṃ duṃ durgāyai śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | 
hraiṃ hrīṃ duṃ durgāyai kavacāya huṃ | hrauṃ hrīṃ duṃ durgāyai 
netratrayāya vauṣaṭ | hraṃḥ hrīṃ duṃ durgāyai astrāya phaṭ | ityādi pūjayet | 

tataḥ patreṣu pūrvādi | jaṃ jayāyai namaḥ | viṃ vijayāyai namaṃ | kiṃ kīrtyai 
namaḥ | prīṃ prītyai namaḥ | praṃ pramāyai namaḥ | śaṃ śraddhāyai namaḥ | 
maṃ medhāyai namaḥ | śaṃ śrutyai namaḥ |

<p. 20b> 
patrāgreṣu pūrvādi | śaṃ śaṃkhāya namaḥ | caṃ cakrāya namaḥ | gaṃ 
gadāyai namaḥ | khaṃ khaḍgāya namaḥ | paṃ pāśāya namaḥ | aṃ aṅkuśāya 
namaḥ | śaṃ śarāya namaḥ | caṃ cāpāya namaḥ | tadvāhye | indrāya namaḥ | 
agnaye namaḥ | yamāya namaḥ | nir(-)ṛtaye namaḥ | varuṇāya namaḥ | vāyave 
namaḥ | kuberāya namaḥ | īśānāya namaḥ | pūrveśānayormadhye brahmaṇe 
namaḥ | nir(-)ṛti varuṇayormadhye

<p. 21a> 
anantāya namaḥ | anenaiva krameṇa | vajrāya namaḥ | śaktaye namaḥ | daṃḍāya 
namaḥ | khaḍgāya namaḥ | pāśāya namaḥ | aṃkuśāya namaḥ | gadāyai namaḥ 
| triśūlāya namaḥ | padmāya namaḥ | cakrāya namaḥ | ityādi saṃpūjya | 

abhīṣṭasiddhiṃ me dehi śaraṇāgatavatsale |
bhaktyāsamarpayet tubhyaṃ samastāvaraṇārcanam || 

iti devasya caraṇayorarghodakaṃ kṛtvā | dhūpaṃ samarpayet | dhūpapātraṃ 
phaḍiti saṃprokṣya namaḥ |

<p. 21b> 
iti saṃpūjya mūlāṃte sāṃgāyai saparivārāyai śrīdurgāyai dhūpaṃ 
samarpayāmi namaḥ | arghodakena samarpayet | jagaddhvani maṃtramātassvāhā | 
iti ghaṃṭāṃ saṃpūjya | vāmahastena tāṃ vādayan | devasya pādādi 
nābhiparyantaṃ dhūpaṃ dadyāt | anenaiva krameṇa dīpaṃ pādādi 
netraparyaṃtaṃ dhūpapātraṃ devasya vāmabhāge dīpapātraṃ dakṣiṇe 
sthāpayet | 

tataḥ sajalaṃ saghṛtaṃ pāyasādi yathā

<p. 22a> 
labdhaṃ vā naivedyamānīya | mūlenācamanīyaṃ devatāyai dattvā | phaḍiti 
saṃprokṣya | mūlamaṃtramaṣṭadhā japtvā | dhenumudrayā vaṃ ityamṛtīkṛtya 
namaḥ iti saṃpūjya | vāmāṃguṣṭhena pātraṃ pṛśan | devamukhāttejo 
niḥsṛtaṃ vibhāvya sāṃgāyai saparivārāyai śrīdurgāyai idaṃ naivedyaṃ 
samarpayāmi namaḥ | ityarghodakenotsṛjya | dakṣahastena prāṇādipaṃcamudrāḥ 
pradarśayet | mūlenācamanīyaṃ datvā |

<p. 22b> 
prāvaraṇaṃ dhṛtvā | yathāśakti mūlamaṃtraṃ japitvā prāvaraṇamapasārya 
pūrvokta ṛṣyādi nyāsānvidhāyācamya īśānabhāge | nirmālya bhojine 
śeṣikāyai namaḥ | iti naivedyāṃśaṃ datvā | mūlena upāyanaṃ tāmbūlaṃ | 
chatraṃ cāmaraṃ ādarśaṃ pradarśayet | mūlena ārārtikaṃ kṛtvā | 

buddhiḥ savāsanā kḷptā darpaṇaṃ maṃgalāni ca | 
manovṛtirvicitrā te nṛtyarūpeṇa kalpitā ||

<p. 23a> 
dhvanayogītarūpeṇa śabdāvādya prabhedataḥ || 
chatrāṇi tava padmāni kalpitāni mayā prabho || 

suṣumṇā dhvajarūpeṇa prāṇādyāścāmarātmanā || 
ahaṃkāro gajatvena vegaḥ kḷpto rathātmanā || 

indriyāṇyaśvarūpāṇi śabdādīn rathavartmanā ||
manaḥpragraharūpeṇa vivekaḥ sārathistvayam || 

sarvamanyat tathā kḷptaṃ tavopakaraṇātmanā || 

ityātmārpaṇa maṃtrān paṭhitvā ||

<p. 23b> 
puṣpāṇi santu mama devi sadendriyāṇi dhūpo gururvapuridaṃ hṛdayaṃ pradīpaḥ 
prāṇāhaṃvīṣikaruṇāni navākṣatāste pūjā phalaṃ bhajatu sāṃpratameṣa 
jīvaḥ || 

kuṃkumena samālabdhe candanena vilepite ||
bilvapatra kṛtā piṃḍa durgehaṃ śaraṇāgataḥ || 

rūpaṃ dehi jayaṃ dehi bhagaṃ bhagavati dehi me || 
putrān dehi dhanaṃ dehi sarvān kāmāṃśca dehi me ||

mahiṣaghni mahāmāye cāmuṃḍe muṃḍamālini ||                                        
āyurārogyamaiśvaryaṃ dehi devi namostute ||

<p. 24> 
iti puṣpāṃjaliṃ datvā | 

culukodakamādāya | itaḥ pūrvaṃ prāṇabuddhi dehadharmādhikārato 
jāgratsvapnasuṣuptyavasthāsu manasāvācākarmaṇā hastābhyāṃ 
padbhyāmudareṇa śiśnā yatsmṛtaṃ yaduktaṃ yatkṛtaṃ tatsarvaṃ 
śrīdurgādevatāyai samarpitamastu | iti datvā | pradakṣiṇāṃ kṛtvā | praṇamya | 
arghaṃ gṛhītvā | trirbhrāmya parāṅmukhaṃ dhṛtvā | śrīdurgādyarghapātrāya 
namaḥ | ityarghapātraṃ saṃpūjya |

<p. 25> 
saṃhāramudrāṃ vadhvā | 

gaccha gaccha paraṃ sthānaṃ svasthānaṃ parameśvari || 
yatra brahmādayo devāḥ na viduḥ paramaṃ padam || 

iti paṭhitvā yaṃtraṃ puṣpaṃ gṛhītvā nāsāpuṭe saṃyojyapuṣpeṇāhṛtaṃ 
tejorūpaṃ nāsādhvanā hṛdgataṃ vibhāvayet | anayā pūjayā śrībhagavatī 
durgā prīyatāmityuktā | mūlena tilakaṃ kṛtvā caraṇodakaṃ pītvā | naivedyaṃ 
kiṃcit svayaṃ bhuktā śrīdurgā bhinnamātmānaṃ bhāvayed [iti nityārcana 
kramaḥ saṃkṣepaḥ] || 

śubham || 




